ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: De Stijl
Board: /styles/de-stijl
Companions: de-stijl-starter.html, de-stijl-study.ai, de-stijl-study.psd

Document
2400 × 2400 px, 300 ppi. Ground #f7f4ee, which is a color, not "empty."

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Black bars, 24 px, horizontal and vertical only
- Yellow rectangle
- Blue rectangle
- Red rectangle
- Ground

Rules
Bars sit on top of the color, as intervals, not as outlines drawn around each block.
No diagonal layer. No circle. No texture. No photograph of a building.
Shift the bars until the white counts. Do not center the set.
